      "title": "Scales by design",
      "items": [
        "Sound is judged on the phone: no server GPU per member",
        "API is stateless; state lives in PostgreSQL, so App Service scales out",
        "Est. Hedera message fees ≤ R569.47/month at any member count (roots coalesced to ≤1 per 60 s + hourly; $0.0008/msg; R16.2075/$)",
        "Verification runs in each viewer's browser, not on our server"
      ]
    },
